### Set the default device configuration
###
### gamescope.service starts EmulationStation itself, as its own client, so
### there is no separate frontend unit here the way essway.service followed
### sway.service. The handshake that tells the client where the compositor is
### only works inside one process tree.
cat <<EOF >/storage/.config/profile.d/090-ui_service
UI_SERVICE="gamescope.service"
EOF
